  <description lang="en-GB" default="true">Demon sword with centipede motif said to be an incarnation of the Great Centipede.\nAttacking Strength: ★★★-\nCritical Hit: ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ja-JP" default="false">大百足様の化身とも言われる、ムカデをモチーフにした妖刀。\n攻撃力： ★★★-\n会心度： ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-US" default="false">Demon sword with centipede motif said to be an incarnation of the Great Centipede.\nAttacking Strength: ★★★-\nCritical Hit: ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-SG" default="false">Demon sword with centipede motif said to be an incarnation of the Great Centipede.\nAttacking Strength: ★★★-\nCritical Hit: ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="fr-FR" default="false">Épée démoniaque ornée d’un motif de mille-pattes, censée être l’incarnation du Grand Mille-Pattes.\nPuissance d’attaque : ★★★-\nCoup critique : ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="es-ES" default="false">Espada demoníaca con motivo de ciempiés, se dice que es la encarnación del Gran Ciempiés.\nFuerza de ataque: ★★★-\nGolpe crítico: ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="it-IT" default="false">Spada demoniaca con motivo di centopiedi, si dice sia l'incarnazione del Grande Centopiedi.\nPotenza d'attacco: ★★★-\nColpo critico: ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="de-DE" default="false">Dämonenschwert mit Tausendfüßler-Motiv, das die Inkarnation des Großen Tausendfüßlers sein soll.\nAngriffsstärke: ★★★-\nKritischer Treffer: ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-HK" default="false">擁有蜈蚣圖騰的妖刀，相傳是巨大蜈蚣的化身。\n攻擊力：★★★-\n會心一擊：★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-TW" default="false">擁有蜈蚣圖騰的妖刀，相傳是巨大蜈蚣的化身。\n攻擊力：★★★-\n會心一擊：★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ko-KR" default="false">지네 문양이 있는 마검으로, 거대 지네의 화신이라고 전해진다.\n공격력: ★★★-\n치명타: ★+[#Legal]</description>
